================================================================================

Context:
Settings → GitHub painted the info banner, Test connection / Take over /
Sync all toolbar and last-sync row immediately, while only the form waited
behind the loading spinner. GET /settings/github often takes a few seconds,
so the toolbar sat idle next to "Loading GitHub settings…". Hide the whole
section body until the fetch finishes.

Changes:

