================================================================================
## Stop GitHub import spinner hanging on Reading…
================================================================================

Context:
Load from GitHub showed Reading… indefinitely. GET /settings/github/obx
returned the full envelope, the browser JSON-parsed it, then POSTed it to
/settings/registry/import/preview (warehouse lookups per domain) with no
fetch timeout. The spinner only hid after both hops finished.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/domain/settings/GitHubSettings.py
   Preview on the server; stash the envelope for confirm; reject empty repos.
2. src/api/routers/internal/settings.py
   POST /settings/registry/import accepts ``from_github=1`` and uses the stash.
3. src/front/static/registry/js/registry.js
   Render the preview JSON directly; 60s AbortController; confirm sends
   from_github instead of re-uploading the envelope.
4. src/back/objects/registry/gitsync/GitHubSyncService.py
   Log file/domain counts and duration for the OBX rebuild.
5. tests/units/settings/test_github_settings.py
   Preview+stash, empty repo, envelope TTL.
6. tests/units/front/test_registry_obx_import_rename.py
   Contract: abort + renderImportObxPreview, no second preview POST.

